sequenceDiagram
    participant Browser as Browser
    participant GW as data-science-gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant BFF as core-bff<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant ModBFF as Module BFF Pod<br/>8143/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant KRBP as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Node as Node.js Backend<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant DSP as DataScience Pipelines<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant MR as Model Registry API<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant KServe as KServe<br/>HTTPS

    Note over Browser,K8s: Flow 1: Core-BFF Path (modern)
    Browser->>GW: GET / (HTTPS/443)<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    GW->>BFF: Forward (HTTP/8080)<br/>x-forwarded-access-token
    BFF->>K8s: API call (HTTPS/6443)<br/>Bearer Token (impersonation)
    K8s-->>BFF: API response
    BFF-->>GW: HTML/JSON response
    GW-->>Browser: Response

    Note over Browser,K8s: Flow 2: Module Federation Remote Loading
    Browser->>GW: GET /_mf/gen-ai/remoteEntry.js<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    GW->>BFF: Forward (HTTP/8080)
    BFF->>ModBFF: Proxy /_mf/gen-ai/* (HTTPS/8143)<br/>Internal SA token
    ModBFF-->>BFF: JS bundle
    BFF-->>GW: Forward response
    GW-->>Browser: Remote module loaded
    Browser->>GW: POST /gen-ai/api/v1/inference<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    GW->>ModBFF: Forward (HTTPS/8143)<br/>x-forwarded-access-token
    ModBFF->>K8s: API call (HTTPS/6443)<br/>Bearer Token (impersonation)
    K8s-->>ModBFF: Response
    ModBFF-->>GW: JSON response
    GW-->>Browser: Inference result

    Note over Browser,Node: Flow 3: Legacy Path
    Browser->>KRBP: GET / (HTTPS/8443)<br/>Auth: OpenShift OAuth
    KRBP->>Node: Forward (HTTP/8080 localhost)<br/>x-forwarded-access-token
    Node->>K8s: API call (HTTPS/6443)<br/>Bearer Token (impersonation)
    K8s-->>Node: API response
    Node-->>KRBP: Response
    KRBP-->>Browser: Response

    Note over Browser,KServe: Flow 4: BFF to Platform Services
    Browser->>GW: POST /api/pipelines/*<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    GW->>BFF: Forward
    BFF->>DSP: REST proxy (HTTPS/8443)<br/>Bearer Token
    DSP-->>BFF: Pipeline result
    BFF-->>GW: Response
    GW-->>Browser: Pipeline result

    Browser->>GW: GET /api/model-registry/*<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    GW->>BFF: Forward
    BFF->>MR: REST proxy (HTTPS/8443)<br/>Bearer Token
    MR-->>BFF: Registry data
    BFF-->>GW: Response
    GW-->>Browser: Registry data
